    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's way too expensive and i'm pretty sure im just wiped out from the workout. if i take like 1000mg instead of 2000mg, is that safe enough to stop the dizziness and cramps without messing with my heart? i just need to know if i can handle this myself at home tonight.",
